        <description><![CDATA[
          <div style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 260px;">
            <b>Type:</b> Pothole / road damage<br/>
            <b>Severity:</b> Medium pothole<br/>
            <b>Notes:</b> Patchwork road surface, commonly flagged during monsoon — verify current condition.<br/>
            <i>Preloaded reference marker — verify before relying on it</i>
